  <questiondescription format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p id="concept">Commercial Arithmetic III: hire purchase price and extra</p><p id="description">Grade 12 CBE Essential 2.4 (d): Find the deposit, the hire purchase price and the extra paid over the cash price, from an advert's deposit percentage and instalments.</p><p id="edition">Essential</p><p id="provenance">This question is adapted from Chapter 5 (Practical arithmetic), Section 4 and Exercise H, question 1 of School Mathematics Project, SMP Book 5 (Metric), ed. P. G. Bowie, Cambridge University Press, 1969: cash price against a deposit and instalments; new items and numbers, no loan charge.</p><p id="citation">INNODEMS CBC Grade 12 Mathematics, first draft by Ben Davies, 2026. Aligned to the KICD Senior School Curriculum Design, Essential Mathematics Grade 12 (draft).</p>]]></text></questiondescription>
